    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おや、バッグを
取ってきたザマスか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, I say, you
have my bag?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>子どものくせに
なかなか役に立つザマスわね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, for children, you
certainly are useful.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280072</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これでまた人を騙して、
がっぽがっぽ金が入るザマス。
ホホホホ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, now I can trick even
more people out of all their
savings. Ho ho ho ho...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280072</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほら、お礼ザマスよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, here, a reward.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280140</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>５０万ガルド、
手に入れただ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You got 50,000 Gald.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280228</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほら、もう用はないザマス、
さっさと帰るザマス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, hey, I'm done with
you. I say, go away.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ホホホホ、
これ、これ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ho ho ho ho...
Well then...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>次はどこの貧乏人相手に
儲け話をするザマスかね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, which poor sucker
should I swindle next...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ま、やりすぎには
注意しないとザマス……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Well, I say, I should be
careful not to overdo it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>このあいだのじいさんが
首をくくったのは
失敗だったザマスね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, that old man who
hanged himself was
a mistake on my part.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれでは、最後まで金を
搾り取れないザマスからね。
ホホホホホ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, if they do that, I don't
make as much money!
Ho ho ho ho ho...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>4</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あいつ……
もう許せね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dammit, this guy...
Y'know what, I'm gonna...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280636</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;、ダメだよっ……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't, &lt;Dio&gt;...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280716</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>な、何ザマス！
暴力はいけないザマス！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wh-What, I say!?
Violence is wrong, I say!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280768</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;！　どけよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Move it, &lt;Mel&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280968</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>殴ってどうなるの！
こんな人殴っても……
なんにもならない！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What does punching him do!?
No matter how many times you
hit him, it won't change anything!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280968</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>殴ったって、この人は
後悔も反省もしないよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can hit him and hit him and he still
won't reflect on his actions at all!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280968</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうなったら、
みじめな気持ちになるのは
&lt;Dio&gt;のほう……違う？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And then you'll be the
only one who feels bad,
&lt;Dio&gt;. Am I wrong?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281024</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>くっ……なんだよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ugh... What the hell...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281136</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ホッホッホ……あたしを
守ってくれたお礼にまた
５０万ガルドあげるザマス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ho, ho, ho. I say, for
protecting me, you can
have another 50,000 Gald!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281220</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いりません！
さっきもらったお金も……
返します！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't need it! Actually,
you can take back the
money from earlier, too!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281280</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>５０万ガルドを返しただ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You returned 50,000 Gald.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281376</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふん……
お金を大切にしない人は、
お金に泣くザマスよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph... I say, those who don't
hold on to their money will
end up crying over money.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……どうして……？
……どうして……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Why...?
...Why...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あなたは……あなたは
寂しい人</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're... You're a sad
and lonely person.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お金では自由にならないものが
あるはず</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm sure there are things
money can't buy you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281664</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふん……
幸せなお嬢ちゃんだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph... You're such
a happy young lady...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281664</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ウッ……クッ……ゲホッ！
ゲホッ　ゲホッ　ゲホッ！
ゲホッ　ゲホッ　ゲホッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ooh... Waah!
*sob* *sob*</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281716</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>大丈夫ですか！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Are you alright!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>触るな！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't touch me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お金……あたしには……
お金しかないザマス！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Money... For me... I say,
money is all I have!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人の心……信頼、絆……
金で得られないものが
たくさんあることなんて</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Love, trust, relationships...
There are so many things
you can't buy with money.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなことは知っている！！
知っているさ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I know all of
that! I know!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だから、どうした！
そんなものを手に入れて
何になる！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And, so what!? Even if
I had all of those things,
what would change!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>4</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すべてはかなくもろく、
崩れ去る……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>All is vanity!
Ashes to ashes!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>5</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私はもう……
ゲホッ……行く！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm just... *sob*
I'm leaving!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>6</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お金で買えないもの、
もうひとつあるザマス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, there's one more
thing money can't buy.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それは自分の命ザマス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, it's your life.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>金をこれだけ貯めても
命だけは買えなかったザマス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, I've gathered so much money,
and I could not buy my own life.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……アタシは近いうちに
死ぬ……ザマス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say... Soon, very
soon, I will die.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282308</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もう２度と会うことは
ないザマス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, we will
not meet again.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんか……
アイツ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What the...
This guy...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282428</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん……
かわいそう、だね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah... I feel
kind of bad now...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282492</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふたりとも……
元気出して……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Cheer up...
you two...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……平気だよ、エト</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I'm okay, Ethos.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282636</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……行こうぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Let's go.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282752</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうして……
ふたりが悲しい気持ちに
なんなくちゃいけないの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why...do they have
to feel so sad?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282752</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あんな人のために……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>For someone like that...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
